  "details": "I just tested if https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/video-memory-leak is still a thing and can confirm that I am still observing a leak.\nIn my test the video memory went from 962MB to 1575MB.\nThe test went like this:\nMeasured VRAM usage in my home world in a specific place.\nWent to BETA HUB 2018 and had a friend switch between avatars.\nWent back to the home world to check VRAM usage again.\nAs uploading the log to gist.github and to paste.ubuntu, because of its size: http://motofckr9k.ddns.net/m/output_log_14-46-41.txt",
